{"Denial cache serves stale denials that override correctly-refreshed permission cache - the denial cache is checked first in Check() and short-circuits all subsequent checks, but is never invalidated when the permission cache is refreshed with newly-granted permissions, causing incorrect authorization denials for up to 30 seconds": 0.9207913279533386, "Ambiguous cache keys from shared underlying cache - userPermDenialCacheKey uses underscore separator between action, name, and parent components, and shares the same cache instance as userPermCacheKey, creating potential key collisions when action values contain underscores (e.g., action='X_Y_Z' in perm cache could collide with action='X', name='Y', parent='Z' in denial cache)": 0.703222930431366}